5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should focus on the external factors that have caused our previous timetables to fail.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree, but we also need to see how our current locations and opening hours affect who can actually reach us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I’d like to examine how the funding is structured, not just the total amount, to see where the strain appears later.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to check the records of programmes we started six years ago to see what actually stuck and what quietly failed.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m worried about whether our staff have the right skills for whatever we choose, so I’ll look into the volunteer register.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Ryuji, I’m looking into the winter road closures north of the river to see how they disrupted our access.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Yumi, I’m checking the bus links in the two outer wards to see how residents currently reach us.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@George, I’m reviewing the county grant terms and the endowment to understand how the funding is shaped over time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@May, I’m checking the attendance sheets from former outreach stops to see who actually showed up when we tried this before.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Daisuke, I’m also checking the neighbourhood associations and tool certification to see if the skills we need are already there.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, does the grant structure actually protect us from the winter disruptions I’m tracking?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, the closures shut roads, but the halls kept their evening timetables. I’m checking the bus links to see if that gap is permanent.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, the grant covers session fees for twelve months, but it doesn’t account for seasonal access failures.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@May, I’m reviewing the two programmes begun six years ago to see which ones actually survived the initial funding drop.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Daisuke, I’m checking the volunteer register and supervision training to see if we have the capacity to manage new commitments.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if the grant expires before winter, we’re exposed. I’m checking the road closures to see if that risk is real.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@George, if the grant expires before winter, we’re exposed. I’m checking the road closures to see if that risk is real.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, the grant covers fees, not access. If roads close, the money sits unused. I’ll confirm the endowment terms.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"@May, I’m checking the two programmes begun six years ago to see which ones actually survived the initial funding drop.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Daisuke, I’m checking the volunteer register and supervision training to see if we have the capacity to manage new commitments.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
