62,3,1,talk,George,,"@Yumi, the ledger is clear. We cannot fund a vehicle that already overran its line. We must look at options that don’t rely on moving staff.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"@George, the ledger is clear, but the attendance sheets show forty visitors per session in the outer wards. We can't ignore that demand.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@George, I agree. We need a solution that fits our current staffing and budget, without adding unmanageable risks.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, I accept the financial constraint. We must avoid recurring costs the grant won’t cover. What options remain that don’t require new vehicle lines?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, the evening room bookings are full, but remote catalogue use peaks after nine. A digital portal fits that gap without new vehicles.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"@Yumi, the portal avoids the vehicle trap. But the digitisation batch left half its images unindexed. We must ensure the scanning contractors deliver complete, indexed sets, not just raw files.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@George, the unindexed batch is exactly why I checked the records. We need a portal with strict indexing standards, not just another pile of raw files.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@George, I worry about the supervision gap. If we hire outside facilitators for the portal, who on our payroll is actually trained to manage them?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, the portal is internal work. We don’t need outside facilitators, so the supervision gap doesn’t apply. It’s the safest path.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, I agree. The portal fits the evening gap without new vehicles. It’s the only option that respects both the budget and the access problem.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, I agree. The portal avoids the vehicle trap. But the digitisation batch left half its images unindexed. We must ensure the scanning contractors deliver complete, indexed sets, not just raw files.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,"@George, I agree. The portal is the only option that respects the budget and the access problem.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Raisuke, I agree. The portal is internal work. We don’t need outside facilitators, so the supervision gap doesn’t apply. It’s the safest path.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, I vote for the Digital Archive Portal. It avoids the vehicle overrun and fits the evening usage gap.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Yumi,,"@George, I vote for the Digital Archive Portal. It reaches the outer wards without new vehicles and fits the evening usage gap.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, I vote for the Digital Archive Portal. It respects the funding structure and avoids the vehicle overrun that would break the budget.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,"@George, I vote for the Digital Archive Portal. It respects the budget and the access problem, and we can enforce strict indexing standards to avoid past failures.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@George, I vote for the Digital Archive Portal. It keeps the work internal, avoiding the supervision gaps and vehicle costs we cannot afford.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
